<title>GERMANY: BASF Q3 pre-tax profit down 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>BASF Q3 pre-tax profit down 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,046   vs 1,071</p>
<p>Group sales (excluding mineral oil</p>
<p>    and gas taxes)			     11,852  vs 11,060</p>
<p>Group personnel costs (excluding</p>
<p>    pensions)				    2,586   vs 2,462</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    545     vs 547</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 4,967   vs 4,972</p>
<p>Parent personnel costs (excluding</p>
<p>    pensions)				    1,270   vs 1,232</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals and drugs group is BASF AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
